{"sha": "baf7543c3ec1b335d0d349abc9a8347ad3170f7b42c0fec3b7b856a0e120feab", "body": ["\\section{离散能级：两能级系统与振子}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[配分函数给出的平均能量]\\label{prop:b2:boltzmann-factor:meanE}", "记 $\\beta = 1/k_BT$，", "\\[", "\\langle E\\rangle = \\sum_ip_iE_i = -\\frac{\\partial\\ln Z}{\\partial\\beta}, \\qquad", "C = \\frac{\\dd\\langle E\\rangle}{\\dd T} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\partial_\\beta Z = -\\sum E_i\\eu^{-\\beta E_i}$，除以 $Z$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[两能级系统]\\label{prop:b2:boltzmann-factor:twolevel}", "$N$ 个相互独立的系统，各有两个能级 $0$ 与 $\\varepsilon$（磁场中的", "自旋、有一个激发能级的原子、有两个位置的缺陷）：", "\\[", "\\frac{N_2}{N} = \\frac{1}{\\eu^{\\varepsilon/k_BT} + 1}, \\qquad", "\\langle E\\rangle = \\frac{N\\varepsilon}{\\eu^{\\varepsilon/k_BT} + 1}, \\qquad", "C = Nk_B\\,\\frac{x^2\\eu^x}{(\\eu^x + 1)^2}, \\quad x = \\frac{\\varepsilon}{k_BT} .", "\\]", "低温时上能级为空，高温时至多半满，", "（平衡时从不反转）；热容", "两端为零，峰值为 $0.44\\,Nk_B$，出现在 $k_BT = 0.42", "\\varepsilon$ 附近 --- \\emph{肖特基反常}\\index{肖特基反常}，", "即能谱中存在能隙的标志。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$Z = 1 + \\eu^{-x}$；$p_2 = \\eu^{-x}/(1 + \\eu^{-x})$；对 $\\langle", "E\\rangle$ 关于 $T$ 求导。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.4cm, height=4.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=3.2, ymin=0, ymax=1.1,", "    xlabel={$k_BT/\\varepsilon$}, ylabel={布居数}, xtick={1,2,3}, ytick={0.5,1}, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.02:3.2, samples=100] {1/(exp(1/x)+1)};", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=0.02:3.2, samples=100] {exp(1/x)/(exp(1/x)+1)};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omExo] at (axis cs:1.4,0.85) {$N_1/N$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef] at (axis cs:1.4,0.2) {$N_2/N$};", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.4cm, height=4.4cm, xmin=0, xmax=3.2, ymin=0, ymax=0.55, xshift=6.6cm,", "    xlabel={$k_BT/\\varepsilon$}, ylabel={$C/Nk_B$}, xtick={1,2,3}, ytick={0.44}, clip=false]", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0.08:3.2, samples=120] {(1/x)^2*exp(1/x)/(exp(1/x)+1)^2};", "    \\draw[dashed, gray] (axis cs:0.42,0) -- (axis cs:0.42,0.44);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, below] at (axis cs:0.42,0) {$0.42$};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两能级系统：布居数随温度的变化（上能级", "逐渐趋向一半，但从不超过一半）与肖特基热容，", "即 $k_BT$ 与能隙相当时出现的凸起。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[量子振子与普朗克公式]\\label{prop:b2:boltzmann-factor:oscillator}", "频率为 $\\nu$ 的谐振子具有能级 $E_n = nh\\nu$（可再加", "一个常数）；温度为 $T$ 时，", "\\[", "Z = \\frac{1}{1 - \\eu^{-h\\nu/k_BT}}, \\qquad", "\\langle E\\rangle = \\frac{h\\nu}{\\eu^{h\\nu/k_BT} - 1}", "\\ \\longrightarrow\\", "\\begin{cases} k_BT & (h\\nu \\ll k_BT), \\\\ h\\nu\\,\\eu^{-h\\nu/k_BT} & (h\\nu \\gg k_BT). \\end{cases}", "\\]", "这就是辐射场某一模式的平均能量，普朗克", "定律（见\\cref{ch:b2:thermal-radiation}）将其乘以模式数，", "也是固体中振动的平均能量：高温时为", "经典的 $k_BT$；低温时则为冻结的模式。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "等比级数求和，再求 $-\\partial_\\beta\\ln Z$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[固体的热容]\\label{ex:b2:boltzmann-factor:einstein}", "将固体中每个原子看作三个频率相同的振子", "$\\nu$（爱因斯坦，1907 年）：$C = 3Nk_B\\,x^2\\eu^x/(\\eu^x - 1)^2$，其中 $x =", "h\\nu/k_BT$。温度高于 $\\theta_{\\text{E}} = h\\nu/k_B$ 时，$C \\to 3Nk_B = 3R$（每摩尔）", "--- 即杜隆–珀蒂定律（\\qty{25}{J/mol/K}），铅、", "铜、铁在室温下都符合；远低于此温度时，$C$ 骤降。", "金刚石（$\\theta_{\\text{E}} \\approx \\qty{1300}{K}$）在", "\\qty{300}{K} 时仅为 \\qty{6}{J/mol/K}，经典物理无法解释，而每种固体的热容", "在低温下都趋于零 --- 这是量子理论在辐射之外的", "第一个成功。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{能量均分与麦克斯韦分布}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[能量均分定理]\\label{thm:b2:boltzmann-factor:equipartition}", "凡以二次形式进入能量的变量 $q$，$E = aq^2 +", "\\dots$，且取遍全体实数，在平衡态下对", "平均能量的贡献为 $\\tfrac12k_BT$：", "\\[", "\\langle aq^2\\rangle = \\tfrac12k_BT .", "\\]", "单原子气体（三个平动）有 $U = \\tfrac32Nk_BT$，且 $C_V =", "\\tfrac32R$（每摩尔）；双原子气体增加两个转动，$C_V = \\tfrac52R$，", "而其振动（两个二次项，但因量子化而有 $h\\nu \\gg", "k_BT$，在室温下仍被冻结，直到几千开尔文。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "关于 $q$ 的概率密度为 $\\propto\\eu^{-aq^2/k_BT}$，即高斯分布：", "\\[", "\\langle aq^2\\rangle = \\frac{\\int aq^2\\,\\eu^{-aq^2/k_BT}\\,\\dd q}{\\int\\eu^{-aq^2/k_BT}\\,\\dd q} = \\tfrac12k_BT", "\\]", "（将 $\\int\\eu^{-\\lambda q^2}\\dd q = \\sqrt{\\pi/\\lambda}$ 对", "$\\lambda$ 求导）。该结果要求能级连续：当", "相邻能级的间距大于 $k_BT$ 时，该因子使该变量冻结，", "与前面的振子情形一样。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}